rooms_desc ({"   You are now in beautifull Seducer`s house and all what    see is very nice .You are pleased that you can visit this   Sometimes sadly,sometimes jolly boy in his own house   This is only first room in this house and you can see   a corridor continues to the north   There is only wooden wardrobe","      As you come here you see that this house isnt so small as    you thought. You see bathroom to east, kittchen to north and    sitting room to west. There is a wonderful carpet on the floor    and a lot of flowers make air in this room fresh."," You entered the bathroom in Seducer`s house.Its ordinary bathroom. There is tub with size of a little swimmpool.Then there is a shower and washbasin.Behind the mirror is a box with men cosmetics.","      Till now you know from where comes so pleasant odour that    you feel after them when you came into this house.Seducer cooks    here only slovak national food which are the best of the world.    If you are hungry and want to try how it tastes then tell Seducer    and he will cook for you \" Bryndzove halusky \" which tastes well.","        You see a big room with large window opposite easten door.    By the southen wall is a big bookcase with a lot of various books.    Between window and northen door is a TV set and in front of them you    can see a sofa with a lot of pillows around.Nearby easten door is    a Hi-Fi Tower.But you cant see it because around are many CD`s,    Cassettes and Records.On the floor is a warm carpet.","     At the easten wall are some wardrobes.Nearby westen window is    a small table.In the middle of this room is a large bed.You feel   that you AREN'T wanted here when here are Seducer and his Love Istore...",0,0,0,0,})
